{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfQCVcrYU26F8faDu7ahQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and all tests pass. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment** ✅\n- Added `quantity` field to Order and Shipment (default 1, must be ≥1)\n- Added `Fulfilment` data class tracking allocated, delivered, and status\n- Added `FulfilmentStatus` enum: UNALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, DELIVERED\n- Created `OrderService` to calculate fulfilment status and validate allocation\n- Implemented shipment state transitions:\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` (CREATED → CONFIRMED)\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver` (CONFIRMED → DELIVERED)\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel` (CREATED → CANCELLED)\n- Added `PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity` to amend quantity (with 409 conflict if below allocated)\n- GET endpoints report fulfilment status; list accepts `?fulfilment=STATUS` filter\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation** ✅\n- Orders for non-existent customers rejected with HTTP 422 through error envelope\n- GET /customers/{id} for unknown customer returns HTTP 404 through error envelope\n- Added `CUSTOMER_DOES_NOT_EXIST` and `CONFLICT` error codes\n- Updated OrderControllerTest to create customers before orders\n\n### 3. **Pagination** ✅\n- All list endpoints (customers, orders, shipments) accept `limit` (1-100, default 100) and `offset` (0+, default 0)\n- Responses include `X-Total-Count` header with total count before slicing\n- Invalid parameters rejected with HTTP 400\n- For orders, total reflects the fulfilment filter\n\n**Test Results:** All 13 tests pass. No new Maven dependencies added. No unrelated files modified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":277,"cache_read_input_token